    {
      "text": "what shall be the sign of thy coming, Matt. 24:3 (JS—M 1:4). so shall also the coming of the Son of man be, Matt. 24:27 (JS—M 1:43). evil servant shall say … My lord delayeth his coming, Matt. 24:48 (Luke 12:45; JS—M 1:51). Son of man … coming in the clouds of heaven, Matt. 26:64. waiting for the coming of our Lord Jesus, 1 Cor. 1:7. they that are Christ’s at his coming, 1 Cor. 15:23. in the presence of our Lord … at his coming, 1 Thes. 2:19. stablish your hearts unblameable … at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ, 1 Thes. 3:13. are alive and remain unto the coming of the Lord, 1 Thes. 4:15. beseech you, brethren, by the coming of our Lord, 2 Thes. 2:1. destroy with the brightness of his coming, 2 Thes. 2:8 (D&C 5:19). whose coming is after the working of Satan, 2 Thes. 2:9. coming of the Lord draweth nigh, James 5:8 (D&C 106:4). made known unto you the power and coming of our Lord, 2 Pet. 1:16. Where is the promise of his coming, 2 Pet. 3:4. Looking for … the coming of the day of God, 2 Pet. 3:12. not be ashamed before him at his coming, 1 Jn. 2:28.",
